Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The idea this program implements — reading the quota an AI coding tool has
left on the machine you are sitting at, and putting it somewhere you can see
it — comes from CodexBar by Peter Steinberger:

    https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar
    MIT License, Copyright (c) Peter Steinberger

CodexBar is a macOS menu-bar application. subnsub-monitor is an independent
implementation in a different shape: a headless agent that dials out, so a
browser can watch a machine it has no route to. No CodexBar source code is
used or included here.

Credit follows the idea, not the source tree. CodexBar got there first.

